   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Possible sums when rolling two dice:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>2<sup>nd</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SUM</td>\n<td><b>Choices</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n<td><b>5</b></td>\n<td><b>6</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1<sup>st</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>5</b></td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>6</b></td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>12</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>There are 36 possible outcomes. Only one of those outcomes has a sum of 12.</p>\n<p>35 outcomes do not have a sum of 12.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Roll result</td>\n<td>Value</td>\n<td>Probability</td>\n<td>Value × Probability</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sum of 12</td>\n<td>Win $30</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{{36}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{30}{{36}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sum not 12</td>\n<td>Lose $1</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{35}{{36}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"- \\frac{35}{{36}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Sum:</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"- \\frac{5}{{36}} \\approx \\$ 0.14\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The expected value of a bet on 12 is <span data-math=\"- \\frac{5}{{36}}\"></span>or a loss of $0.14.</p>"
    },
