  {
   "id": 516336,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Players  can bet that the next roll of the dice will be “any craps” (a sum of 2, 3, or 12). Winners get $7 and losers lose $1.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Possible sums when rolling two dice:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>2<sup>nd</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SUM</td>\n<td><b>Choices</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n<td><b>5</b></td>\n<td><b>6</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1<sup>st</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>5</b></td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>6</b></td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>12</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>There are 36 possible outcomes. Four of those outcomes have a sum of 2, 3, or 12.</p>\n<p>32 outcomes do not have a sum of 12.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Roll result</td>\n<td>Value</td>\n<td>Probability</td>\n<td>Value × Probability</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sum of 2, 3, or 12</td>\n<td>Win $7</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{4}{{36}} = \\frac{1}{9}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{7}{9}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sum not 2, 3, or 12</td>\n<td>Lose $1</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{32}}{{36}} = \\frac{8}{9}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"- \\frac{8}{9}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Sum:</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"- \\frac{1}{9} \\approx  - \\$ 0.11\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The expected value of a bet on 2, 3, or 12 is <span data-math=\" - \\frac{1}{9}\"></span>or a loss of $0.11.</p>\n<p>With all the bets, you lose money over the long run. You are better off not betting at all. If you must bet, you lose money at the slowest rate with the last bet. The “any craps” bet loses $0.11 on average per bet. Regarding the casino’s interests, the casino is better off with the bet on 7, since players lose the most with that bet.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "If the player bets on any craps, the expected value is <span data-math=\"- \\$ 0.11\">- \\$ 0.11</span>.\n<br>\nThe best bet for the player is any craps; the best bet for the casino is the bet on 7."
    }
   ],
